                              LBEQ   opf   ; checked: skip, and check the closer
F213                          ENDIF      
F213   35 10                  PULS   X   
F215   34 20                  PSHS   Y   
F217   6E 84                  JMP   ,X   
F219                             ; 22h pushes the address of the text after it and skips the string.
F219                             ; skipstr: IP is inside a string; step past its closing quote. "/" escapes
F219                             ; the next character, so "/"" does not end it. Leaves A = 22h. (The checked
F219                             ; build's is after skip.)
