F219   36 20        H_STR:    PSHU   Y   
F21B   8C                     FCB   8Ch   ; (CMPX #: steps over the LEAY)
F21C   31 21        SS0:      LEAY   1,Y   
F21E   A6 A0        SKIPSTR:   LDA   ,Y+   
